1
00:00:06,716 --> 00:00:08,876
Amy? Amy?

2
00:00:09,085 --> 00:00:11,285
(Sheldon:)Oh, right, funeral.

3
00:00:11,521 --> 00:00:13,041
Amy?

4
00:00:15,425 --> 00:00:16,825
(Amy:)Hello, Sheldon.

5
00:00:17,060 --> 00:00:19,220
(Sheldon:)I'm not allowed to wear
my Silver Surfer tie...

6
00:00:19,429 --> 00:00:22,059
(Sheldon:)...but you can wear a bathrobe?

7
00:00:22,399 --> 00:00:24,329
(Amy:)I think I'm too sick to go to the funeral.

8
00:00:24,768 --> 00:00:27,428
(Sheldon:)You're sick? You poor kid.

9
00:00:27,637 --> 00:00:29,467
Well, see you.

10
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:32,430
(Amy:)Sheldon, aren't you gonna take care of me?

11
00:00:32,642 --> 00:00:36,472
Me? No, I'm not that kind of doctor.

12
00:00:37,414 --> 00:00:39,574
(Amy:)But our relationship agreement
clearly states...

13
00:00:39,783 --> 00:00:42,583
(Amy:)...when one of us is sick,
the other must take care of them.

14
00:00:42,752 --> 00:00:45,282
Oh. I see the confusion.

15
00:00:45,488 --> 00:00:50,988
(Sheldon:)The intent behind that clause
was to force you to take care of me when I'm ill.

16
00:00:52,195 --> 00:00:55,285
(Sheldon:)When you're feeling better,
you'll think that's funny.

17
00:00:58,768 --> 00:01:10,028
(Amy:)Never mind. Good night, Sheldon.

